#: ../../source/fs.scandir_README.md:7
msgid ""
"The package is aimed at obtaining information about entries in the "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fs.scandir_README.md:9
msgid ""
":moneybag: Returns useful information: `name`, `path`, `dirent` and "
"`stats` (optional)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fs.scandir_README.md:10
msgid ""
":gear: On Node.js 10.10+ uses the mechanism without additional calls to "
"determine the entry type. See [`old` and `modern` mode](#old-and-modern-"
"mode)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fs.scandir_README.md:11
